      "text": "From the rhythm of Rio to the roar of Iguazu and the crystal-clear waters of Fernando de Noronha, discover Brazil at its most vibrant, wild and breathtaking, from iconic cities to untouched tropical shores. In Pernambuco, in the northeast, turquoise water, white sand and palm trees line some of Brazil’s finest beaches, such as Porto de Galinhas, while the islands of Fernando de Noronha, a protected marine reserve with remarkably clear water and rich marine life, are a mecca for divers.",
